---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../../config";

const title = "Hair Botox vs. Keratin Treatment";
const description =
  "Hair botox vs. keratin treatment: which one actually fixes your hair problem? A clear comparison for Elmwood Park clients choosing a smoothing service.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} path="/hair-botox-vs-keratin/">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 prose-section">
    <p class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium mb-2">
      <a href="/" class="hover:underline">Keratin Treatment Elmwood Park</a> / Hair Botox vs. Keratin
    </p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-900 mb-5">
      Hair Botox vs. Keratin Treatment
    </h1>
    <p>
      Despite the name, "hair botox" has nothing to do with actual Botox — no injections, no neurotoxin. It's a
      deep conditioning treatment built around peptides, vitamins, and filling agents that repair and add density to
      damaged strands. It's frequently confused with keratin treatments because both leave hair smoother and
      shinier, but they solve different problems.
    </p>

    <h2>The Core Difference</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Keratin treatments</strong> are primarily about smoothing and frizz control — they coat and seal the
      hair shaft to reduce frizz and cut styling time. <strong>Hair botox</strong> is primarily about repair — it
      fills in gaps in damaged, porous hair to restore softness, density, and shine, with a smoothing effect as a
      side benefit rather than the main goal.
    </p>

    <h2>Which One Do You Need?</h2>
    <p>
      If your main complaint is frizz, humidity-frizz, and long styling time, a
      <a href="/" class="text-brand-600 font-medium">keratin treatment</a> is usually the better match. If your hair
      feels dry, brittle, or over-processed from coloring or heat damage, hair botox addresses that underlying
      damage more directly. Some clients alternate between the two, or combine a lighter
      <a href="/cysteine-treatment/" class="text-brand-600 font-medium">formaldehyde-free keratin</a> service with
      periodic hair botox for maintenance.
    </p>

    <p>
      Not sure which fits your hair? <a href={`tel:${SITE.phone}`} class="text-brand-600 font-medium">Call {SITE.phoneDisplay}</a>
      and a stylist can assess your hair and recommend the right service.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
